  "description": "Reusable Backend-For-Frontend engine for ASP.NET Core. Terminates auth server-side: holds Keycloak tokens in a Redis-backed session, hands the browser only an opaque httpOnly cookie, and forwards Bearer tokens to downstream services via YARP. Server-side ROPC, silent refresh with a per-session SETNX lock, and CSRF protection. A per-app BFF becomes a ~20-line Program.cs.",
